<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n1091" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀγωγός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>leading, guiding</i>, and
			as Subst., <i>guide</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				3.26
			</span></i>; <i>escort</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				2.12
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				4.78
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. ὕδατος</span>”
				<i>aqueduct,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Mon.Anc.Gr.
					19.5
				</span></i>
			 (pl.); without <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὕδατος</span>,
				<i><span class="en">
				Just.
				<u>Nov.</u>
				128.16
			</span></i> (pl.): c. gen., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δύναμις ἀνθρώπων
				ἀ.</span> power <i>of leading</i> men, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Lyc.</u>
				5
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>leading towards</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπί τι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>R.</u>
					525a
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>D.</u>
				3.12
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰς</span> . . <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Per.</u>
				1
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>drawing, attracting</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δύναμις ἀ.
				τινος</span>, of the magnet, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				5.130
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>drawing forth, eliciting</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χοαὶ νεκρῶν ἀγωγοί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Hec.</u>
					536
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δακρύων ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Tr.</u>
					1131
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γυναικείων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Aph.</u>
					5.28
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐμμήνων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Dsc.
					1.16
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> abs.,
				<i>attractive</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Crass.</u>
				7
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ ἀ.</span>
			<i>attractiveness</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				2.25b
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
